cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MuchoCore"
message: "If you use MuchoCore in a project, server, article, benchmark, or other technical work, please cite this software."
type: software
abstract: >-
  MuchoCore is an open-source PHP 8.3+ Geometry Dash Private Server (GDPS)
  core for hosting, migrating, securing, and operating self-hosted Geometry
  Dash private servers with MariaDB, Docker, Caddy, an integrated Admin Panel,
  client patching tools, and version-aware Geometry Dash protocol compatibility.
authors:
  - family-names: "IZK"
    given-names: "MuchoCore Maintainers"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IZKGMD/GMDmucho-core"
url: "https://muchogdps.space/muchocore/"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - "geometry-dash"
  - "geometry-dash-private-server"
  - "gdps"
  - "gdps-core"
  - "geometry-dash-server"
  - "php"
  - "mariadb"
  - "docker"
  - "cvolton"
  - "private-server"
